  "description": "OpenCvSharp4 bindings for Periphery.Camera. AsMat() wraps a captured frame as a cv::Mat with no copy, ToMat() hands back an owned one, and ToBgr() converts any capture format to CV_8UC3 BGR — so an OpenCV pipeline can open a specific camera by identity instead of guessing at VideoCapture(0).",
